  partName: Bolt
  description: The Bolt is a small, compact component positioned at the middle-center-center
    of the engine, serving as a fastening device to secure various engine components
    together. Constructed from Material.004, its sturdy design and material properties
    ensure a secure and reliable connection. Interestingly, the Bolt's design features
    a precise thread pattern and torque specification to prevent over-tightening
    or loosening.
